---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for Creator Growth Tools.">
  <section class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Creator Growth Tools is a static editorial site. It does not collect account registrations, payment details, or user-submitted personal data.</p>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>This site currently loads one small first-party script. When you click an outbound link it fires an event inside your own browser page only; nothing is stored, sent anywhere, or written to a cookie. No third-party analytics, advertising, or tracking library is installed. Traffic and link performance are reviewed in Pinterest Analytics and affiliate network dashboards, which are operated by those companies under their own privacy policies. If a privacy-preserving page analytics tool is added later, this page will be updated first.</p>
      <h2>Outbound links</h2>
      <p>When you click a link to a third-party website, including an affiliate link, that company may process information according to its own privacy policy.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>This site does not currently publish a public contact address.</p>
      <p>Last updated: 2026-08-31.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
